  "content": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row gx-40\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\">    <div class=\"post-8833 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-informacion-machu-picchu category-informacion-turistica category-machu-picchu tag-costos-machu-picchu tag-machu-picchu tag-precio-machu-picchu tag-viajar-a-machu-picchu vs-blog blog-single\">\n    <!-- Post Thumbnail --><div class=\"blog-img\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" decoding=\"async\">\n<source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18.jpg.avif 1200w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-600x450.jpg.avif 600w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-300x225.jpg.avif 300w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-1024x768.jpg.avif 1024w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-768x576.jpg.avif 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18.jpg.webp 1200w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-600x450.jpg.webp 600w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-300x225.jpg.webp 300w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-1024x768.jpg.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\">\n<img fetchpriority=\"high\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18.jpg 1200w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-600x450.jpg 600w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-300x225.jpg 300w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo_2024-07-03_18-06-18-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\">\n</picture>\n</div><!-- End Post Thumbnail --><div class=\"blog-content \"><h2 class=\"blog-title\">¿Cuanto cuesta Viajar a Machu Picchu en 2025?</h2><!-- Blog Meta --><div class=\"blog-meta\"><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/2025/04/11/\"><i class=\"far fa-calendar-alt\"></i><time datetime=\"2025-04-11T12:32:59-05:00\">11 de abril de 2025</time></a><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/author/chullosdev25web/\"><i class=\"fal fa-user\"></i>Chullos Tours Perú</a></div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Machu Picchu es un destino único, pero planificar su visita requiere conocer los costos actualizados. En este artículo,&nbsp;<strong>Chullos Tours</strong>&nbsp;te brinda un desglose detallado de los precios para que organices tu viaje sin sorpresas.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-dd8341abf6df3c57812c8c84b4466a63\" style=\"color:#6b0014\"><strong>Costos Básicos para Visitar Machu Picchu</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Entradas a Machu Picchu</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/machu-picchu-full-day-tour/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"trip\" data-id=\"8083\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Machu Picchu Solo</a></strong>: S/152 (USD 45) – Acceso general.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/machu-picchu-full-day-tour/\" data-type=\"trip\" data-id=\"8083\">Machu Picchu + Huayna Picchu</a></strong>: S/200 (USD 65) – Incluye la montaña icónica (cupos limitados).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Machu Picchu + Montaña Machu Picchu</strong>: S/200 (USD 65) – Ruta más larga y exigente.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Importante</strong>: Los precios pueden variar según temporada. Compra tus boletos con anticipación en el&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.machupicchu.gob.pe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">portal oficial del Ministerio de Cultura</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Transporte</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Tren (Ollantaytambo – Aguas Calientes)</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>PeruRail Expedition</strong>: Desde USD 60 (solo ida).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Inca Rail Voyager</strong>: Desde USD 70 (solo ida).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bus (Aguas Calientes – Machu Picchu)</strong>: USD 24 (ida y vuelta).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Consejo</strong>: Si buscas ahorrar, considera el trekking o combinar caminata con tren.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Guía Turístico</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Obligatorio para ingresar</strong>: Desde S/100 (USD 30) por grupo.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-25c3a92b0669bdcf9516cc8cdd228f99\" style=\"color:#6b0014\"><strong>Opciones de Alojamiento</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Aguas Calientes (Hostal Económico)</strong>: Desde USD 30/noche.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Hoteles 3–4 estrellas</strong>: USD 70–150/noche.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Lujo (Belmond Sanctuary Lodge)</strong>: USD 1,000+/noche (junto a la entrada de Machu Picchu).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Recomendación</strong>: Reserva con meses de anticipación en temporada alta (junio–agosto).</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-69565da4a72ff719163ed56227b86688\" style=\"color:#6b0014\"><strong>Tours y Paquetes Turísticos</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/machu-picchu-full-day-tour/\" data-type=\"trip\" data-id=\"8083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tour Económico (1 día)</a></strong>: Desde USD 290 (incluye tren, entrada, guía y bus).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/tour-machu-picchu-2-dias/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"trip\" data-id=\"8054\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Paquete 2D/1N</a></strong>: USD 350–500 (con alojamiento y comida).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/descubre-cusco-3-dias/\" data-type=\"trip\" data-id=\"8116\">Cusco Discover 3 Días</a></strong>: Desde USD 650 (incluye permisos, campamento y guía).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>→ Compara nuestros paquetes todo incluido</strong></a>.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-wptravelengine-trips wpte-gblock-wrapper\">\t<div class=\"category-list wte-d-flex wte-col-3 wpte-trip-list-wrapper columns-3\">\n\t<div class=\"category-trips-single\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n\t<div class=\"category-trips-single-inner-wrap\">\n\t\t<figure class=\"category-trip-fig\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"category-feat-ribbon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"category-feat-ribbon-txt\">Presentado</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <span class=\"cat-feat-shadow\"></span> -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://chullostours.com/tours/machupicchu-full-day-con-tren-observatory/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"490\" src=\"https://chullostours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/DSC_3116-1-700x490.avif\" class=\"attachment-trip-single-size size-trip-single-size wp-post-image\" a